{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月21日，據CNBC報道，英偉達股價周五暴跌14%，連續第七個交易日下跌。隨着投資者對黃仁勳(Jensen Huang)卸任後的公司前景日益擔憂，英偉達股價持續承壓。該股已連續第七周收跌，為2008年金融危機以來最長的連續周跌勢。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587376.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.703738+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:13:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_hash":"cfb305482cbcae0a2f4ec82bdfe8b37fb0bea9a85268e600aedbf1b8f10b1724","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}